# Stock report format

Every report in `analysis/` must follow `methodology/09-report-format.md` exactly.

- Read `methodology/09-report-format.md` before writing; copy its §5 skeleton.
- Keep every section and its number; write `不適用：原因` instead of deleting a section.
- Fill every §3 score from this fetch. `未評估` only as `methodology/09-report-format.md` §1.2 allows.
- Keep the fixed `### 關鍵數據補充：價量疊圖` subsection under 關鍵數據. Chart PNG goes to `analysis/img/{代號}_price_volume_overlay_{As of date}.png`; follow `methodology/09-report-format.md` §7. Never draw an SMA whose window is incomplete.
- Amounts in NT$億, dates in YYYY-MM-DD.
- Run the §6 self-check before finishing.
